DIMENSION: Architecture and feature-gating soundness.

Read src/lib.rs, the root Cargo.toml, packages/michi-node/Cargo.toml, docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-03-michi-design.md sections 1 through 3 (feature taxonomy and module map), and every #[cfg(feature = ...)] usage across src/. Check:
